        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Medic, hurry!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Medic, hurry!"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No way... Why is your body all frostbitten? What happened to you...",
