        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "Don't worry, it's minor."
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   Meteorite and Jessica are still in the main square.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "Meteorite and Jessica are still in the main square."
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   They should be safe for the time being, but it's hard to say how long that's going to last for.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "They should be safe for the time being, but it's hard to say how long that's going to last for."
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Frostleaf\"]   I managed to lure the enemy out, so Reunion hasn't found them yet.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Frostleaf",
        "content": "I managed to lure the enemy out, so Reunion hasn't found them yet."
    },
